-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  coff_pdb_codeview.adam - A debug build's CodeView in its object (M7b): the
  compiler (imported from its own src\, beside bin\) runs in this process on
  a small sample program it writes beside its exe, lowers the sample's own
  module alone (LowerUnit, SU2.4), generates it (GenerateSections, a debug
  build: the format part writes the debug sections), writes the object
  (FormatPart.WriteObject) and prints its debug sections read back from the
  object bytes (CoffCodeViewText): the module's .debug$S (objname, compile,
  the UDTs, the string table and file checksums), each function's piece
  going with its code (proc, frame, self / params / locals from the frame
  base register, end, its lines by file), each variable's piece going with
  its storage, and .debug$T (builtins by index; Link's pointer to itself
  through a forward record, unique names module-qualified).
*******************************************************************************/

